    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Apply the six-stimulation protocol and 50% progressive-response criterion to every eligible node pair in the 27 testable models. Reproduce whether every model has at least one qualifying pair and the per-model 1-50% range.";
